---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Us - Who We Are & Our Mission | TechFixSteps" description="Learn about TechFixSteps, India's trusted source for latest government jobs, sarkari naukri updates, exam results, admit cards, answer keys, and college admissions at techfixsteps.com.">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-8 tracking-tight text-text-main">About <span class="gradient-text">AstroBlog</span></h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p class="text-xl text-text-main font-medium">Welcome to AstroBlog, your premier destination for high-quality technical content, web development tutorials, and insights into the future of technology.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main pt-6">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Our mission is to simplify complex technology for developers, designers, and tech enthusiasts. We believe that great information should be accessible, well-structured, and easy to digest.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main pt-6">What We Cover</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Web Development:</strong> Deep dives into Astro, React, Tailwind CSS, and modern JavaScript.</li>
        <li><strong>AI & Innovation:</strong> Exploring how artificial intelligence is shaping our digital world.</li>
        <li><strong>Design Systems:</strong> Best practices for creating scalable and beautiful user interfaces.</li>
        <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Tips and tricks for achieving perfect Core Web Vitals scores.</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main pt-6">The Team</h2>
      <p>AstroBlog is run by a dedicated team of developers and writers who are passionate about sharing their knowledge. We pride ourselves on accuracy, clarity, and providing value to our readers.</p>
      
      <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-8 mt-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4">Want to contribute?</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">We're always looking for guest writers and collaborators. If you have something interesting to share with our community, get in touch!</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary inline-flex">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
